.convert-temp
*~
*.swp
*.swo
*.tps
*.tcp
*.log
*.out
*.aux
*.synctex
*.pyc
*__pycache__*
*.dblite
.idea/
build/
render/
output/
source/
# ...but those four are *build stages at the repository root*, and the patterns are bare, so
# they also match any directory of that name at any depth. `core/html/vendor/mathjax/output/`
# is MathJax's font data, which is vendored on purpose and has to be in the repository: without
# this line it was silently left out and a fresh clone rendered no maths at all.
!core/html/vendor/**
_*/
.idea/*
svg-inkscape/
*.minted
